@startuml Zemen_EventLifecycle
!define TITLE Event Lifecycle State Machine
title TITLE
skin rose

[*] --> Created : user creates event

Created --> Active : start_time_utc <= now\n(event begins)

Active --> Completed : end_time_utc <= now\n(event ends)

Created --> Cancelled : user deletes\nwhile not started

Active --> Cancelled : user deletes\nduring event

Completed --> Archived : manual archive\nor auto after 90 days

Cancelled --> [*] : no further action

Completed --> [*] : no further action

Archived --> [*] : no further action

note right of Created
  Event persisted in DB
  Participants can be added
  Version = 1
  Reminders scheduled
end note

note right of Active
  start_time_utc <= now
  Event is ongoing
  Participants notified via reminder
  Version increments if edited
end note

note right of Completed
  end_time_utc has passed
  Snapshot retained for audit
  Participants see as past
end note

note right of Cancelled
  Deleted from active view
  Snapshots retained for audit
  Participants notified
end note

note right of Archived
  Moved to history
  Not shown in default calendar view
  Data preserved long-term
end note

@enduml
